dim]plugins sync`, and the full `npm test` / `npm run validate` suite [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]stay unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]split_largest_bob_plugins_js_files.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/split_largest_bob_plugins_js_files.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-47[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-47/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split task-status-cycler main.js and establish the plugin [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]source build[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]split-task-status-cycler[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-task-status-cycler: pilot the src/ fragment build, staleness [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check, and parity check on the smallest target plugin. Document the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract and split plugins/task-status-cycler/main.js into fragments [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus plugin-class mixins.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split bob-ledger-tools main.js[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-ledger-tools[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-task-status-cycler[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-ledger-tools: apply the established build contract to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins/bob-ledger-tools/main.js. Preserve its load-time CodeMirror [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]let/try setup and widget classes, and repoint keep-in-sync comments in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]other plugins.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split bob-navigation-hotkeys main.js[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-navigation-hotkeys[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-ledger-tools[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-navigation-hotkeys: apply the build contract to the 52k-line [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins/bob-navigation-hotkeys/main.js. This includes mixin splits of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]both the plugin class and the 6.4k-line BulletPropertyPickerModal, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its super calls and duplicate onClose.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split scripts/test-navigation-hotkeys.cjs[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-navigation-hotkeys-tests[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-navigation-hotkeys[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-navigation-hotkeys-tests: move the shared preamble and file-wide [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]helpers into a harness module, and split the 500 tests into per-area [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test files listed in package.json. The same 500 names must still pass.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split scripts/test-task-status-cycler.cjs[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-task-status-cycler-tests[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-navigation-hotkeys-tests[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-task-status-cycler-tests: reuse the harness convention to split [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the 179 cycler tests into per-area files. Keep the stub-assigned [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]MarkdownView/TestModal classes shared through the harness.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-47","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-47.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_n